# Save/load stage 3 (tests/save/save_reload.toml): a third process with the saves of stage 2 (two saves of the
# same character in two processes). The same way in through CONTINUE as in save_continue.kufscript.
# Press START; the storage message: the first confirm makes the game look for its saves (enumerate, then
# open the package with OPEN_EXISTING), the second closes the message; then Down to CONTINUE.
# Menu confirmations use "press" (held 4 frames), as a player would.
500 tap Return
700 press Return
850 press Return
1000 press Down
1050 capture main_menu
1100 press Return
1250 capture continue_list
1300 repeat 60 until gameplay press Return

# Readings: status screen, then the Items tab, with the cursor on row 2 (RB) on both, as in save_continue's
# status_resaved and equipment2_resaved (a highlighted row's text is brighter; rows compare like with like)
@gameplay+300 tap Tab
@gameplay+340 press Down
@gameplay+380 capture status_reloaded
@gameplay+400 tap C
@gameplay+540 capture equipment2_reloaded
@gameplay+560 tap Escape
